sequenceDiagram
    participant vLLM as vLLM/SGLang Pod<br/>5557/TCP ZMQ PUB
    participant ZMQ as ZMQ Subscriber
    participant Pool as kvevents.Pool<br/>Sharded Workers
    participant Adapter as EngineAdapter<br/>vLLM / SGLang
    participant Index as kvblock.Index<br/>Redis 6379/TCP
    participant Router as llm-d-router<br/>Library Consumer
    participant Indexer as kvcache.Indexer
    participant TokenProc as TokenProcessor<br/>FNV-64a / CBOR
    participant Scorer as kvblock.Scorer
    participant Client as HTTP Client
    participant Manager as kv-cache-manager<br/>8080/TCP
    participant Tokenizer as UDS Tokenizer<br/>Python Sidecar

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over vLLM,Index: Flow 1: Write Path — KV-Event Ingestion
        vLLM->>ZMQ: KV-event (msgpack)<br/>ZMQ SUB, no encryption
        ZMQ->>Pool: Route via FNV-1a(pod_id)<br/>Go channel
        Pool->>Adapter: Parse msgpack wire format
        Adapter-->>Pool: BlockStored / BlockRemoved / AllBlocksCleared
        Pool->>Index: Update block index<br/>TCP 6379, pipelined + Lua scripts
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Router,Scorer: Flow 2: Read Path — Pod Scoring (Library)
        Router->>Indexer: ScoreTokens(prompt, pods)
        Indexer->>TokenProc: Compute block keys<br/>FNV-64a over CBOR
        TokenProc-->>Indexer: Block key sequence
        Indexer->>Index: Lookup(blockKeys, pods)<br/>TCP 6379
        Index-->>Indexer: Pod → block hits
        Indexer->>Scorer: Score by prefix hit ratio<br/>weighted by device tier
        Scorer-->>Indexer: PodScore[]
        Indexer-->>Router: Ranked pod scores
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,Tokenizer: Flow 3: HTTP Scoring (Standalone)
        Client->>Manager: POST /score_completions<br/>HTTP 8080, no auth
        Manager->>Tokenizer: Tokenize prompt<br/>gRPC/UDS
        Tokenizer-->>Manager: Token IDs
        Manager->>Indexer: ScoreTokens(tokens, pods)
        Indexer->>Index: Lookup(blockKeys, pods)<br/>TCP 6379
        Index-->>Indexer: Pod → block hits
        Indexer-->>Manager: PodScore[]
        Manager-->>Client: JSON response
    end
